---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Privacy Policy"
	description="Privacy Policy regarding personal data handling, cookies, Google AdSense, and affiliate advertising on Midnight Manga Vault."
	pubDate={new Date('August 19 2026')}
>
	<h2>1. Personal Information We Collect</h2>
	<p>
		When you submit an inquiry through our contact form or leave feedback, you may be asked to provide personal details such as your name and email address. We use this information solely to respond to your inquiries and provide necessary assistance. We will never use your personal information for any other purposes without your explicit consent.
	</p>

	<h2>2. Disclosure of Personal Information to Third Parties</h2>
	<p>
		We properly manage personal information and do not disclose or provide it to third parties except in the following circumstances:
	</p>
	<ul>
		<li>When the user gives explicit consent</li>
		<li>When disclosure is required by law or legal proceedings</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>3. Use of Cookies and Tracking Technologies</h2>
	<p>
		This blog uses cookies to enhance user experience, analyze website traffic, and serve personalized advertisements. A cookie is a small text file sent to your browser by a website you visit. Cookies do not contain information that directly identifies individuals. You can configure your browser settings to decline or delete cookies at any time.
	</p>

	<h3>3-1. Web Analytics (Google Analytics)</h3>
	<p>
		We utilize Google Analytics to collect anonymous traffic data. This service uses cookies to help us understand visitor interactions and improve website content. The data collected is anonymous and does not identify individual visitors.
	</p>

	<h3>3-2. Advertising & Google AdSense</h3>
	<p>
		This blog uses third-party advertising services, including <strong>Google AdSense</strong>.
	</p>
	<p>
		Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on a user's prior visits to this website or other websites on the Internet. Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to our users based on their visit to our site and/or other sites on the Internet.
	</p>
	<p>
		Users may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://adssettings.google.com/authenticated" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Ads Settings</a>. Alternatively, you can opt out of third-party vendors' use of cookies for personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">aboutads.info</a>.
	</p>

	<h3>3-3. Amazon Associates & Affiliate Disclosure</h3>
	<p>
		<strong>Midnight Manga Vault</strong> is a participant in the <strong>Amazon Services LLC Associates Program</strong> and <strong>Amazon.co.jp Associates Program</strong>, affiliate advertising programs designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.com, Amazon.co.jp, and affiliated websites.
	</p>
	<p>
		In addition, this website participates in various affiliate marketing programs (including Moshimo Affiliate, Rakuten Affiliate, and DMM Affiliate) and may earn commissions on qualifying purchases made through links on this site at no additional cost to you.
	</p>

	<h2>4. Disclaimer</h2>
	<p>
		While we strive to provide accurate, up-to-date, and reliable information, we cannot guarantee the absolute accuracy, completeness, or safety of all content. Content and product availability may change over time. Midnight Manga Vault and its operators assume no liability for any direct, indirect, or consequential damages resulting from the use of information or external links provided on this site.
	</p>

	<h2>5. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
	<p>
		We comply with applicable privacy laws and regulations and may periodically review and update this policy. The latest version will always be posted on this page.
	</p>
</Layout>
